# Build output and dependencies.
dist/
node_modules/
.astro/

# Nothing about the generated pages is listed here on purpose.
#
# scripts/sync-docs.mjs writes a self-ignoring .gitignore into each directory it
# owns, so the rule is written by the code that creates the directory. Naming
# them here instead would be a second place to update whenever SOURCES grows,
# and the failure — a generated page committed by accident — is silent.
#
# It also leaves the hand-written sections (examples/, reference/) committable
# with no exception rule to maintain, which a blanket src/content/docs/*/ did
# not.
